# Faerie Slumber Party (CR 400.3, 608.2c): every creature on the battlefield returns to its owner's hand, Bot1's Memnite and Bot2's
# Memnite and Ornithopter alike. Bot2 controlled creatures, and counts once however many: Bot1 creates exactly two Faerie tokens
# (1/1 blue, flying, can block only creatures with flying), not four.

